  "confirmed": [
    "Front end: 16000 Hz mono, FFT512/hop256, periodic sqrt-Hann, centered STFT; reflect padding when length>256, constant padding otherwise.",
    "Offline input shape [B,L], spectral shape [B,257,T,2], last dimension is real/imag; explicit inverse length.",
    "GTCRN uses magnitude/real/imag features, ERB(65,64), SFE(3,1), encoder, two DPGRNN, decoder, complex mask.",
    "DPGRNN intra-frequency GRNN is bidirectional; inter-time GRNN is unidirectional. Temporal conv pad is on left.",
    "ERB high-band expansion uses fixed transpose weights, not an exact inverse.",
    "Official default Enhancer checkpoint is E2; repository also includes completed from-scratch E3 and controlled E3c/E4/E5 continuation.",
    "E4/E5 share input/target/order; only continuation waveform loss coefficient differs. All branches have same 5000-step budget.",
    "Evaluation SI-SDR definition and training waveform loss differ (demeaning and factor10); silence/invalid cases explicitly handled.",
    "Portable runtime uses NumPy/ONNX Runtime/SoundFile, no Torch import in inference engine. Validation separately imports Torch for equivalence.",
    "New-source experiment reports 12 original recordings, 384 mixture cells and 8 clean controls; no retraining and only seed17.",
    "Engineering artifacts and completed runs are not proof of the learner's independent skill."
  ],
